<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;You could keep using &lt;c&gt;splice&lt;/c&gt; and achieve your goal by using a sub.

&lt;c&gt;
sub group {
   my $n = shift;
   my @rv;
   push @rv, [ splice(@_, 0, $n) ] while @_;
   return @rv;
}

my @rv = group($C, @list);
&lt;/c&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Update&lt;/b&gt;: Woops! Fixed issue brought up by haukex in reply.</doctext>
